"Burung Enggang": *squawk*!
Sira: (This is Senggang, a burung enggang.)
if {feeding_animals} == true:
	Sira: (Burung enggangs usually don't like to interact with humans.)
	Sira: (Senggang's species is a revered simbol to our tribe.)
	Sira: (We believe that they're a symbol of protection and a bridge to the spirit realm.)
	Sira: (However, Senggang here is anything but majestic.)
	Sira: (Jitendra has a hard time appeasing him and he will annoy the villagers when he's in a bad mood.)
	Sira: (Nevertheless, Senggang being here means that our forest continues to prosper well because they disperse seed whevere they go.)
	Sira: (I think, according to Jitendra, Senggang and his mate are also in mating season.)
	- Feed Burung Enggang.
		[signal arg="animal_fed"]
		*Senggang seems to enjoy the rambutan*
		*Sira offers him another set of food full of dead critters*
		Sira: (Jitendra said, he might need these for his mate.)
		*he then grabs a mouthful of it and flies off*
	- Later.
		Sira: (I'll feed him later.)